+  # Supply-chain SECURITY gate — advisories only. BLOCKING. Config: deny.toml. Every advisory the
+  # RustSec DB reports is either fixed or carries a written, justified `ignore` in deny.toml; a new,
+  # untriaged advisory fails this check and blocks the merge until a human triages it. A daily
+  # re-scan against the committed Cargo.lock runs from .github/workflows/audit.yml.
   # Rationale: docs/AGENTIC-ENGINEERING.md §4.
-  cargo-deny:
